{"speciesId":675,"names":{"fr":"Pandarbare","es":"Pangoro","en":"Pangoro","ja":"ゴロンダ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"D’un tempérament fougueux, il ne supporte pas que l’on s’en prenne aux faibles. Sa feuille lui permet de deviner les actions de l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es muy temperamental, pero no permite que nadie se meta con los débiles. Mediante su hoja, predice los movimientos del enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Although it possesses a violent temperament, it won’t put up with bullying. It uses the leaf in its mouth to sense the movements of its enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"気性が 荒く ケンカっ早いが 弱いものいじめは 許さない。 葉っぱで 敵の 動きを 読む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il encaisse les attaques de plein fouet sans même tiquer et il poursuit sa route. Il étale ses ennemis d’un coup de patte capable de briser un poteau électrique."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"No se arredra ante los ataques y embiste con una fuerza tan abrumadora que sería capaz de derribar un robusto poste telefónico de hormigón."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It charges ahead and bashes its opponents like a berserker, uncaring about any hits it might take. Its arms are mighty enough to snap a telephone pole."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"攻撃を 受けても ひるまずに 突進して 電柱を へし折る パワーの 腕力で ぶちのめす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"D’un tempérament fougueux, il ne supporte pas que l’on s’en prenne aux faibles. Sa feuille lui permet de deviner les actions de l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Es muy temperamental, pero no permite que nadie se meta con los débiles. Mediante su hoja, predice los movimientos del enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Although it possesses a violent temperament, it won’t put up with bullying. It uses the leaf in its mouth to sense the movements of its enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"気性が 荒く ケンカっ早いが 弱いものいじめは 許さない。 葉っぱで 敵の 動きを 読む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il encaisse les attaques de plein fouet sans même tiquer et il poursuit sa route. Il étale ses ennemis d’un coup de patte capable de briser un poteau électrique."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"No se arredra ante los ataques y embiste con una fuerza tan abrumadora que sería capaz de derribar un robusto poste telefónico de hormigón."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It charges ahead and bashes its opponents like a berserker, uncaring about any hits it might take. Its arms are mighty enough to snap a telephone pole."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"攻撃を 受けても ひるまずに 突進して 電柱を へし折る パワーの 腕力で ぶちのめす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ses gros bras sont sa plus grande fierté. Si vous voulez devenir un Dresseur de Pandarbare, il va falloir jouer des poings !"},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su aspecto imponente rinde justicia a la fuerza de la que hace gala. Todo aspirante a entrenarlo deberá entender el lenguaje de los puños."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It boasts superb physical strength. Those who wish to become Pangoro’s Trainer have no choice but to converse with their fists."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"腕っぷしが 自慢で 豪快。 ゴロンダの トレーナーに なりたいなら 拳で 語り合う しかない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il peut détecter les mouvements ennemis grâce aux vibrations de sa feuille. Avec ses amis, ce grand lunatique a en fait le cœur sur la main."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Predice los movimientos del enemigo mediante su hoja. Pese a su carácter temperamental, se muestra muy afable con sus compañeros."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"From the slight twitches of its bamboo leaf, it deduces its opponent’s movements. It’s eager to tussle but kindhearted toward its companions."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"竹の 葉っぱの 揺れで 敵の 動きを 読む。 ケンカっ早いが 仲間への 情は 厚い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce Pokémon féroce est très fier de ses gros bras. Beaucoup de Dresseurs l’apprécient pour son côté truculent."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Pokémon un tanto agresivo que se jacta de la fuerza de sus puños. A muchos Entrenadores les llama la atención su carácter atrevido."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This rowdy Pokémon boasts great physical strength. Many Trainers are also smitten by its lively character."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"腕っ節が 自慢の ワイルドな ポケモン。 豪快な 性質に 惚れこむ トレーナーも 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est du genre à laisser ses poings parler : il martèle ses ennemis et charge avec assez de force pour envoyer voler un camion-benne."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Prefiere solucionar las disputas a mamporros. Puede embestir un camión y hacerlo volar por los aires a largas distancias sin despeinarse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pangoro is the type to talk with its fists. It doesn’t say much as it pummels opponents with enough force to send a dump truck flying."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"こぶしで 語る タイプ。 ガタガタ いわず ぶん殴り ダンプカーも ふっ飛ばす 突進を かます。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon agressif a recours à la force pour faire taire ceux qui le contrarient. Il adore combattre les Ixon."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este Pokémon de carácter agresivo lo soluciona todo a golpes. Desata su espíritu combativo al enfrentarse a los Obstagoon."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon is quick to anger, and it has no problem using its prodigious strength to get its way. It lives for duels against Obstagoon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"気性が 荒く 腕力で 黙らせる。 タチフサグマとの 一騎打ちに 闘志を 燃やす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il anticipe les mouvements de son adversaire grâce à sa feuille. Ses coups de poing peuvent réduire un camion-benne en un tas de ferraille."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"La hoja que lleva en la boca le permite predecir los movimientos del rival. Puede reducir un camión a chatarra de un solo puñetazo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Using its leaf, Pangoro can predict the moves of its opponents. It strikes with punches that can turn a dump truck into scrap with just one hit."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"葉っぱで 相手の 動きを 読む。 大型 ダンプカーを 一撃で スクラップにする パンチを もつ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":675,"moves":[{"name":"karate-chop","learns":[[15,"level-up",12],[16,"level-up",12],[17,"level-up",12],[18,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"comet-punch","learns":[[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[15,"level-up",35],[16,"level-up",35],[17,"level-up",35],[18,"level-up",35],[20,"level-up",40],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[15,"mach